              "html": "recoveryReportCallback"
            },
            {
              "tag": "td",
              "attrs": [],
              "html": "The callback function to be called by Persistency to report errors in the stored data that were corrected using the available redundancy. The function will be called with the shortName path of the affected Key-Value Storage or File Storage in storage and information on what has been corrected, placed in the parameters recoveryReport Kind, reportedElements, and reportedInstances."
